{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every collection is a copy-on-write struct with the API shape of the standard library’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collections and Swift Collections. Where a structure is a tree or a graph, it also converts to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Grafluent type of that shape ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BinaryTree"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Arborescence"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RootedTree"},{"type":"text","text":"), so Grafluent’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms and drawings run over it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"import GrafluentCollections","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be imported on its own."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import GrafluentCollections","","var scores: FenwickTree = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5, 9, 2, 6]","print(scores.prefixSum(through: 3))  \/\/ 9","print(scores.sum(in: 2 ..< 6))       \/\/ 19"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/grafluentcollections"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","title":"GrafluentCollections","externalID":"GrafluentCollections","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"GrafluentCollections"}]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://GrafluentCollections/documentation/GrafluentCollections":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GrafluentCollections\/documentation\/GrafluentCollections","url":"\/documentation\/grafluentcollections","title":"GrafluentCollections","abstract":[{"text":"Graph-shaped collections for Swift: search trees, tries, suffix structures and decision diagrams","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with value semantics, built on Grafluent.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"}}}